            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La sortie a changé pendant cette action. Vérifiez la sortie actuelle et réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The overview shows the last %lld lines of every Rex pane’s screen on this Mac, refreshed every two seconds while this window is open. That can include commands, file contents or anything else a program printed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "The overview shows the last %lld line of every Rex pane’s screen on this Mac, refreshed every two seconds while this window is open. That can include commands, file contents or anything else a program printed."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "The overview shows the last %lld lines of every Rex pane’s screen on this Mac, refreshed every two seconds while this window is open. That can include commands, file contents or anything else a program printed."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "El resumen muestra %lld línea final de la pantalla de cada panel de Rex en este Mac, actualizada cada dos segundos mientras esta ventana está abierta. Puede incluir comandos, contenido de archivos o cualquier otra cosa que haya mostrado un programa."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "El resumen muestra %lld líneas finales de la pantalla de cada panel de Rex en este Mac, actualizadas cada dos segundos mientras esta ventana está abierta. Pueden incluir comandos, contenido de archivos o cualquier otra cosa que haya mostrado un programa."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "Die Übersicht zeigt die letzte %lld Zeile des Bildschirms jedes Rex-Bereichs auf diesem Mac, alle zwei Sekunden aktualisiert, solange dieses Fenster offen ist. Das kann Befehle, Dateiinhalte oder alles andere umfassen, was ein Programm ausgegeben hat."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "Die Übersicht zeigt die letzten %lld Zeilen des Bildschirms jedes Rex-Bereichs auf diesem Mac, alle zwei Sekunden aktualisiert, solange dieses Fenster offen ist. Das kann Befehle, Dateiinhalte oder alles andere umfassen, was ein Programm ausgegeben hat."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "La panoramica mostra %lld riga finale dello schermo di ogni pannello Rex su questo Mac, aggiornata ogni due secondi mentre questa finestra è aperta. Può includere comandi, contenuti di file o qualsiasi altra cosa stampata da un programma."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "La panoramica mostra le ultime %lld righe dello schermo di ogni pannello Rex su questo Mac, aggiornate ogni due secondi mentre questa finestra è aperta. Possono includere comandi, contenuti di file o qualsiasi altra cosa stampata da un programma."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "La vue d’ensemble affiche la dernière ligne (%lld) de l’écran de chaque sous-fenêtre Rex de ce Mac, actualisée toutes les deux secondes tant que cette fenêtre est ouverte. Cela peut inclure des commandes, le contenu de fichiers ou tout ce qu’un programme a affiché."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "needs_review",
                  "value": "La vue d’ensemble affiche les %lld dernières lignes de l’écran de chaque sous-fenêtre Rex de ce Mac, actualisées toutes les deux secondes tant que cette fenêtre est ouverte. Cela peut inclure des commandes, le contenu de fichiers ou tout ce qu’un programme a affiché."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request timed out.": {
