    "Type the quicklink’s name, a space and a term to put it in place of {query}. Opens http, https, mailto and Shortcuts run links.": {
      "comment": "Quicklink form hint; {query} is a literal placeholder and stays as is",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
